{"ticker":{"symbol":"SGRY","name":"Surgery Partners, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":23.2,"change_pct":0.0012947777298228935,"market_cap":2989895424.0,"pe":110.39734,"pb":1.8008229,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":11.41,"week52_high":23.37,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","country":"United States","city":"Brentwood","employees":16000,"website":"https://www.surgerypartners.com","business_summary":"Surgery Partners, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, owns and operates a network of surgical facilities and ancillary services in the United States. The company provides ambulatory surgery centers and surgical hospitals that offer non-emergency surgical procedures in various specialties, including orthopedics and pain management, ophthalmology, gastroenterology, and general surgery. It offers emergency departments; ancillary services such as physician practices and diagnostic testing; multi-specialty physician practices; urgent care facilities; and anesthesia services. In addition, it offers single- and multi-specialty facilities. Surgery Partners, Inc. was founded in 2004 and is headquartered in Brentwood, Tennessee.","business_summary_ko":"Surgery Partners, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국 내 수술 시설 및 보조 서비스 네트워크를 소유하고 운영합니다. 이 회사는 정형외과 및 통증 관리, 안과, 위장병학, 일반외과 등 다양한 전문 분야에서 비응급 수술 절차를 제공하는 외래 수술 센터와 수술 병원을 제공합니다. 응급실을 제공합니다. 의사 진료 및 진단 테스트와 같은 보조 서비스; 다중 전문 의사 진료; 긴급 치료 시설; 그리고 마취 서비스. 또한 단일 및 다중 전문 시설을 제공합니다. Surgery Partners, Inc.는 2004년에 설립되었으며 테네시 주 브렌트우드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":3154799180.0,"rev_lo":3144400000.0,"rev_hi":3183928080.0,"rev_g":-0.0465,"n":6,"eps":0.35596,"eps_lo":0.21981,"eps_hi":0.6,"eps_g":-0.24260001},{"period":"2027","rev":2800152580.0,"rev_lo":2777300000.0,"rev_hi":2842621460.0,"rev_g":-0.112399995,"n":6,"eps":0.21015,"eps_lo":0.03,"eps_hi":0.43,"eps_g":-0.4096}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"의료기관","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":2539300000.0,"opera